[Quotes]
victory0 = "Over already eh, it mustn't be even a spar..."
victory1 = "Before I get serious, you're down??"
victory2 = "Rhythm's bad? That's an awkward excuse isn't it..."
victory3 = "Whoever my opponent likely is, I won't ease up..."
victory4 = "I don't care where you've trained, it's the proof against me!"
victory5 = "Stay down like that, you're ghastly pale!"
victory6 = "Quit with the bluff, having to mouth things..."
victory7 = "You, regret that extent of strength?"
victory8 = "Tough aren't you, but for stoutness I'm tops."
victory9 = "A turn-around chance then, take it without restraint!"
victory10 = "You plan to hand me a KO? With such a small move..."
victory11 = "I won't allow myself to lose... There's a reason to become of me."
victory12 = "You can't escape! Real fighters know their true calling!"
victory13 = "At ease, loo-suh!"
victory14 = "You hit the ground right when I was about to go berserk. Lucky!"
victory15 = "You say you were out of form? Your excuses are out of control!"
victory16 = "I always give my all no matter who I face."
victory17 = "Damn! Even my sparring partner lasts longer than that!"
victory18 = "You thought you had a chance? C'mon, everyone knows you're no good!"
victory19 = "I don't know where you trained yourself, but you didn't train hard enough. Those moves suck!"
victory20 = "Bluffing will get you nowhere against me. Talk's cheap!"
victory21 = "Just stay down, don't try to stand up. You look pale!"
victory22 = "Damn, I can't believe how poorly I fought. Next time, I will really beat the crap out of you!"
victory23 = "I didn't think I'd have such a hard time with you!"
victory24 = "You're tough, but you can't outlast the best."
victory25 = "You arrogant imbecile, you slacked off right at the end."
victory26 = "You can talk the talk, but you can't walk the walk yet, loser!"
victory27 = "Is it the real you? I thought you were supposed to be top tier."
victory28 = "What, you weren't ready? Were you really that scared of me?"
victory29 = "You shouldn't have held back, punk! Now you'll just be making excuses for losing!"
victory30 = "A rematch? It ain't gonna do you any good. You'll just get beat down again."
